        <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:tefillin/yehi_ratzon">
          <tei:p>May it be thy will, Lord our God and God of our fathers, that <tei:pb n="10" ed="1949 chol/shacharit/birchot_hashachar" facs="https://archive.org/download/PhilipBirnbaumHaSiddurHaShalemTheDailyPrayerBook1949/page/n34_medium.jpg"/>my observance of this precept of <tei:foreign xml:lang="he-Latn">tefillin</tei:foreign> be considered as if I fulfilled it with all its particulars, details and implications, together with the six hundred and thirteen precepts that are related to it. Amen.</tei:p>
        </tei:div>
